# Temporary input files created during document generation
.doc_input.json

# Generated documents (user output — not part of plugin source)
*.pdf
*.docx
*.pptx

# Exception: pandoc reference template is part of plugin source
!assets/reference.docx

# NPM dependencies
node_modules/

# OS files
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# User preferences and company data are stored in ~/.document-generator/
# (outside the repo) and never committed. This is intentional — see
# skills/user-preferences/SKILL.md for the storage architecture.
#
# Storage layout (all in HOME, not in repo):
#   ~/.document-generator/preferences.json   — style, language, defaults
#   ~/.document-generator/logos/              — company logos (png + base64)
